&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Zone 2: All other California locations and Seattle, WA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
