&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Please refer to the ranges below to find the starting annual pay range for individuals applying to work remotely from the following locations for this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
