&lt;li&gt;Skilled at developing and implementing account strategies to maximize customer value and drive revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build strong, trusted relationships and act as a strategic advisor to customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive in identifying risks, resolving issues, and ensuring timely resolutions&lt;/li&gt;
