he Equal Employment Opportunity Commission (EEOC). While we are required by law to ask these questions in the format provided by the EEOC, at Modern Health we know that gender is not binary, and we recognize that these categories do not reflect our employees&#39; full range of identities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
